    "backstory": "Once a promising influencer, Bartholomew \"Barty\" Bonesworth's rise to fame was cut short by the Great Liquidity Drought of '23. Reduced to scavenging the ruins of Brokeland, Barty's only fans now are the glowing-eyed rats that scurry in his wake.",
